rfect sums another final benefit to come when subtracted differences.\n\nFinally, for positive differences:\n\\[\nTom's Sum = (1+4+9+16+25) + (25+36+49+64+81) + (81+98+106+\\dots)\n\\]\nAll squared values sums and multiple tens providing the grown.\n\nHence,\n\\[\n\\boxed{333}\n\\]",
